@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
<div class="form-page ms-0">
    <p>TraceBack displays the item details you choose to publish, including its description, location, date, image URL, and contact preference. Keep personal contact details out of those public fields.</p>
    <p>Your account email is used to sign in and is not shown in public reports. Ownership claim messages are available only to authorized claim reviewers and the person who submitted the claim.</p>
    <p>If you need a report corrected or removed, sign in and manage it from your dashboard or contact your campus service desk.</p>
</div>
